      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Find the map item",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A map item someone shared shows as a <strong>MAP ITEM</strong> with <strong>On map</strong>. Tap <strong>On map</strong> to put it on your map.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/2e47bbe66ba8de8f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Put it on the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The item goes on your map and the map goes to it. Press Back once to close its radial menu and any ODMain alert, then again to close the pane.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/579ca432fde2d7c0.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See who shared it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the item, then the details button in its radial menu. Scroll to <strong>Remarks</strong>, which says who shared it over Matrix.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ad319b17201b254.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2842
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
